  "ingredients": [
    "4 (4 ounce) tilapia fillets",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "0.5 cup all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "2 tablespoons unsalted butter, melted",
    "1 tablespoon lemon juice, or to taste",
    "1 teaspoon chopped fresh flat-leaf parsley, or to taste",
    "0.5 teaspoon chopped fresh thyme, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vnVr7g_JfPrz5zWQOIw5XD8N32M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/201934-pan-seared-tilapia-DDMFS-4133-4x3-step-01-9d596f2734c74a1eb80462021b7f184e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/201934/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rinse tilapia fillets in cold water and pat dry with paper towels. Season both sides of each fillet with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XCIU7X7_s9SZpHPTid_EBJtt8To=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/201934-PanSearedTilapiaRecipe-mfs-Step1-4x3-fc598b7665f14d10abf5c2805bae373e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/201934/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place flour in a shallow dish. Gently press each fillet into the flour to coat and shake off any excess.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eGInZ5qtBiyxgxpoXjXP31WvxxA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/201934-PanSearedTilapiaRecipe-mfs-Step2-4x3-bfd7ef425c904784b2dafb877ae3293a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/201934/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook tilapia fillets in the hot oil, in batches if necessary, until fish flakes easily with a fork, about 4 minutes per side.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/flPu2HmUmf-OGUdwaIaYsMHtdCc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/201934-PanSearedTilapiaRecipe-mfs-Step3-4x3-53ea394ee63b4308a966792a9f792abf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/201934/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brush melted butter onto the tilapia fillets in the last minute before removing from the skillet. Drizzle fillets with lemon juice and garnish with parsley and thyme.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
